hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1632","Narrated to us Harun bin Ishaq al-Hamdani, who said: Narrated to us Abda (meaning Ibn Sulayman al-Kala'i), from Sa'id. And it was also narrated to us by Bundar, who said: Narrated to us Abd al-A'la, who said: He informed us that Sa'id narrated to us, from Sulayman al-Naji, from Abu al-Mutawakkil, from Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (RA), who said: A man came while the Messenger of"
